<mxCell id="f24" value="Products: Character.AI, a custom GPT, an Intercom brand voice. Store the transcript with the persona card and tool outputs. Launch number = fraction of conversations that stayed inside the card; the turn average is for debugging." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="382" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
